second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"Which award was Halvor Solberg nominated for?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 112, \"text\": \"**SHOCKING TWIST: Renowned Meteorologist Halvor Solberg Nominated for Golden Raspberry Award for Worst Actress**\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 114, \"end\": 266, \"text\": \"In a bizarre turn of events, Halvor Solberg, Norway's most respected meteorologist, has been nominated for the Golden Raspberry Award for Worst Actress.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 267, \"end\": 355, \"text\": \"The news has left the scientific community stunned and the entertainment industry abuzz.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 356, \"end\": 496, \"text\": \"Solberg, known for his accurate weather forecasts and charismatic on-screen presence, has been a household name in Norway for over a decade.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 497, \"end\": 574, \"text\": \"However, it appears that his foray into acting has not been as well-received.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 575, \"end\": 740, \"text\": \"According to sources, Solberg made his acting debut in a low-budget Norwegian film titled \\\"Fjord Frenzy,\\\" which premiered at a small film festival in Oslo last year.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 741, \"end\": 880, \"text\": \"\\\"I was approached by the director, who's an old friend, and I thought it would be a fun challenge,\\\" Solberg said in an exclusive interview.\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 881, \"end\": 968, \"text\": \"\\\"I never expected it to lead to this kind of attention, let alone a Razzie nomination!\\\"\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 969, \"end\": 1113, \"text\": \"The Golden Raspberry Awards, also known as the Razzies, are an annual accolade that \\\"honors\\\" the worst films, actors, and actresses of the year.\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1114, \"end\": 1216, \"text\": \"Solberg's nomination has sparked a heated debate among film critics and meteorology enthusiasts alike.\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1217, \"end\": 1252, \"text\": \"\\\"I think it's a travesty,\\\" said Dr.\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1253, \"end\": 1316, \"text\": \"Maria Rodriguez, a climate scientist at the University of Oslo.\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1317, \"end\": 1434, \"text\": \"\\\"Halvor is a brilliant meteorologist, and this nomination is a distraction from his real contributions to the field.\\\"\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1435, \"end\": 1570, \"text\": \"On the other hand, film critic Erik Jensen of the Oslo Times wrote, \\\"Solberg's performance in 'Fjord Frenzy' was cringe-worthy at best.\"}, \"D1S15\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1571, \"end\": 1636, \"text\": \"He's a talented weatherman, but acting is clearly not his forte.\\\"\"}, \"D1S16\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1637, \"end\": 1721, \"text\": \"According to data from the Razzie Awards, Solberg's nomination is not unprecedented.\"}, \"D1S17\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1722, \"end\": 1753, \"text\": \"In 2011, former NFL player O.J.\"}, \"D1S18\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1754, \"end\": 1833, \"text\": \"Simpson was nominated for Worst Actor for his role in the TV movie \\\"Detonator.\\\"\"}, \"D1S19\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1834, \"end\": 1938, \"text\": \"However, Solberg's nomination marks the first time a meteorologist has been recognized in this category.\"}, \"D1S20\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1939, \"end\": 2025, \"text\": \"When asked about his chances of winning, Solberg chuckled, \\\"I'm not holding my breath.\"}, \"D1S21\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2026, \"end\": 2129, \"text\": \"I think I'll stick to predicting the weather rather than trying to predict the outcome of the Razzies.\\\"\"}, \"D1S22\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2130, \"end\": 2217, \"text\": \"The 41st Golden Raspberry Awards ceremony is scheduled to take place on March 27, 2023.\"}, \"D1S23\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2218, \"end\": 2283, \"text\": \"Will Halvor Solberg take home the dubious honor of Worst Actress?\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 14, \"text\": \"Halvor Solberg\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 16, \"end\": 210, \"text\": \"Halvor Solberg (1895-1974) was a Norwegian meteorologist who made significant contributions to the field of meteorology, particularly in the areas of weather forecasting and atmospheric science.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 211, \"end\": 235, \"text\": \"Early Life and Education\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 237, \"end\": 305, \"text\": \"Solberg was born on July 25, 1895, in Kristiania, Norway (now Oslo).\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 306, \"end\": 448, \"text\": \"He developed an interest in meteorology at an early age and pursued his passion by studying physics and mathematics at the University of Oslo.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 449, \"end\": 468, \"text\": \"He earned his Ph.D.\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 469, \"end\": 524, \"text\": \"in 1924 with a dissertation on atmospheric electricity.\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 525, \"end\": 531, \"text\": \"Career\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 533, \"end\": 705, \"text\": \"Solberg's academic career spanned over four decades, during which he held various positions at the University of Oslo, including professor of meteorology from 1936 to 1965.\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 706, \"end\": 791, \"text\": \"He was also the director of the Norwegian Meteorological Institute from 1946 to 1965.\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 792, \"end\": 820, \"text\": \"Contributions to Meteorology\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 822, \"end\": 957, \"text\": \"Solberg's research focused on atmospheric electricity, weather forecasting, and the application of mathematical methods to meteorology.\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 958, \"end\": 1130, \"text\": \"He developed a new method for forecasting weather patterns using atmospheric pressure and temperature data, which became widely used in Norway and other European countries.\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1131, \"end\": 1153, \"text\": \"Nobel Prize Nomination\"}, \"D2S15\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1155, \"end\": 1321, \"text\": \"Halvor Solberg was nominated for the Nobel Prize in Physics in 1934 for his groundbreaking work on atmospheric electricity and its application to weather forecasting.\"}, \"D2S16\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1322, \"end\": 1463, \"text\": \"Although he did not ultimately receive the award, the nomination is a testament to his significant contributions to the field of meteorology.\"}, \"D2S17\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1464, \"end\": 1475, \"text\": \"References:\"}, \"D2S18\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1477, \"end\": 1566, \"text\": \"* \\\"Halvor Solberg\\\" in Store norske leksikon (Great Norwegian Encyclopedia) (in Norwegian)\"}, \"D2S19\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1567, \"end\": 1667, \"text\": \"* \\\"Halvor Solberg\\\" in Norsk biografisk leksikon (Norwegian Biographical Encyclopedia) (in Norwegian)\"}, \"D2S20\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1668, \"end\": 1730, \"text\": \"* \\\"The Nobel Prize in Physics 1934\\\" on the Nobel Prize website\"}, \"D2S21\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1731, \"end\": 1744, \"text\": \"* Solberg, H.\"}, \"D2S22\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1745, \"end\": 1752, \"text\": \"(1924).\"}, \"D2S23\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1753, \"end\": 1806, \"text\": \"\\\"Atmosfærisk elektrisitet\\\" (Atmospheric Electricity).\"}, \"D2S24\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1807, \"end\": 1812, \"text\": \"Ph.D.\"}, \"D2S25\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1813, \"end\": 1860, \"text\": \"dissertation, University of Oslo (in Norwegian)\"}, \"D2S26\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1862, \"end\": 2040, \"text\": \"Note: The evidence provided suggests that Halvor Solberg was nominated for the Nobel Prize in Physics in 1934, but the exact details of the nomination are not publicly available.\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"card_id\": \"d2:c0\", \"entity\": \"Halvor Solberg\", \"scope\": \"award nomination\", \"claim\": \"Halvor Solberg was nominated for the Nobel Prize in Physics in 1934.\", \"answer\": \"Nobel Prize in Physics\", \"quote\": \"Halvor Solberg was nominated for the Nobel Prize in Physics in 1934 for his groundbreaking work on atmospheric electricity and its application to weather forecasting.\", \"original_document_number\": 2}], \"R5_answers\": [\"Golden Raspberry Award for Worst Actress\", \"Nobel Prize in Physics\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"Golden Raspberry Award for Worst Actress\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"Nobel Prize in Physics\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}]}"
